{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter","id":1142181,"title":"What would you want in a Dragon-Blooded Kickstarter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-20T09:24:17-07:00","id":1142181,"title":"What would you want in a Dragon-Blooded Kickstarter?","content":"I guess the first question should be: <b>do you want a Kickstarter for Dragon-Blooded?</b><br /> <br /> The main reason why I do is because of OPP's long tradition of quality Kickstarters (excluding the super-delayed mess that was Exalted Third Edition) with many interesting stretch goals and add-ons. I know that I would back a <i>Dragon-Blooded Deluxe Jade Edition</i> or something similar. I would be happy to see this after Cavaliers of Mars. <br /> <br /> If you want to see a Kickstarter for Dragon-Blooded, <b>what sort of stretch goal do you want to see to motivate funding it?</b><br /> <br /> My answer is <i>Charm Cards</i>. Even though I was hesitant to get all of the Solar Charm Cards, I'm very glad that I have them and they are very useful to me at the table. I'm going to want Dragon-Blooded Charm Cards as well, both for consistency and for practicality. While they are at it, they could do some Martial Arts Charm Cards as well.<br /> <br /> <b>What sort of add-on would you like to see?</b><br /> <br /> <i>Jade Dice Sets</i> (a set of ten d10s for each color jade). You can choose to purchase none of them, one of them or all of them. Then you can happily use the dice corresponding to your character's aspect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T09:50:42-07:00","id":1142190,"title":"","content":"-High-quality/rez detail map of the Realm. I'm fine with blank spaces for people to insert their own cities, but I'd like to see the Realm get a real cool map focus. Maybe a cloth version of this too.<br /> <br /> -Color art, if it's not already a part of it.<br /> <br /> -Definitely yes on the Charm Cards. Love those things. I'd like to see it include some blank digitally editable ones.<br /> <br /> -I think the Jade Dice Sets would be cool, but change the 10's to like a Dragon symbol or something.<br /> <br /> I'm sure I'll think of more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T10:11:02-07:00","id":1142198,"title":"","content":"I'd want a kickstarter only *after* the word count/content is finalized. If it's packing more art / tchotchkes / etc. into the final product, that's cool; but I've had my fill of kickstarters to fund development/writing that get delayed ad infinitum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11690-mizzlfoshizzl","name":"mizzlfoshizzl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11690_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T10:18:19-07:00","id":1142202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mizzlfoshizzl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1142198#post1142198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd want a kickstarter only *after* the word count/content is finalized. If it's packing more art / tchotchkes / etc. into the final product, that's cool; but I've had my fill of kickstarters to fund development/writing that get delayed ad infinitum.</div> </div> </div> </div>They've already officially committed to that criteria going forward. And no, I don't have a quote sadly but I remember it distinctly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T10:18:53-07:00","id":1142203,"title":"","content":"I'd rather any text adding stretchgoals build a supplement rather than add to the book itself (slowing it down).<br /> <br /> Something like Miracles, but also room for other stuff that there wasn't room for in WFHW - sorcerous initiations, other martial arts styles, more setting info on non-Realm DBs, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T10:24:23-07:00","id":1142206,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1142203#post1142203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd rather any text adding stretchgoals build a supplement rather than add to the book itself (slowing it down).<br /> <br /> Something like Miracles, but also room for other stuff that there wasn't room for in WFHW - sorcerous initiations, other martial arts styles, more setting info on non-Realm DBs, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>This has my vote.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T10:35:00-07:00","id":1142210,"title":"","content":"Hopefully with the text already written before it goes up, any &quot;added text stretchgoals&quot; would just be expanding the word count to insert stuff that was already written but otherwise cut, rather than &quot;time to sit down and write more stuff&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T10:41:02-07:00","id":1142212,"title":"","content":"A manual expanding on the culture of each house with some unique charms, artifacts or whatever that they have developed (if we <i>have</i> to include some mechanics).<br /> <br /> Also expanding on other major DB populations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11320-gigaton-falcon-emu","name":"Gigaton-Falcon-Emu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"786"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T11:03:38-07:00","id":1142225,"title":"","content":"- Color art and an option for more color art in supplements. Basically keep the color art train rolling there.<br /> <br /> - Cloth map of the Realm.<br /> <br /> - Reissue of the map of Creation for folks who were not able to get it the first KS.<br /> <br /> - DB-styled screen.<br /> <br /> Those are what come to mind immediately at least.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T11:21:53-07:00","id":1142232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gigaton-Falcon-Emu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1142212#post1142212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A manual expanding on the culture of each house with some unique charms, artifacts or whatever that they have developed (if we <i>have</i> to include some mechanics).<br /> <br /> Also expanding on other major DB populations.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unique House Charms are an interesting idea - though surprising that they wouldn't cross lines pretty quickly thanks to fathers teaching their children of the children's mother's house.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T12:16:48-07:00","id":1142252,"title":"","content":"I'd take a Terrestrials Kickstarter, but I care little for deluxe editions, since I generally prefer the PDF format. I could see myself getting one anyway if there were cool stretch goals, though. The kind of things I like to see include:<br /> <br /> As has been said, full colour artwork. Also more of it. <br /> <br /> A raise to the writers. That was a popular one in the Core KS, and no matter if I liked the outcome or not, I want it to be beneficial to try your pen at Exalted.<br /> <br /> In the same vein, extra funds for proofreading. I cannot sufficiently express how it annoys me when there's a penalty negator for a penalty that's not actually stated to exist, or similar. That did happen with Core, and I'd rather not it was repeated.<br /> <br /> Any extra material offered should be published as supplements rather than included in the book (seriously, the way Core looks, I don't blame people for not daring to try it; I probably wouldn't).<br /> <br /> A bit of a personal issue, but if they have rewards with the idea of &quot;have your character's name in a piece of text&quot;, I want them to make clear they're using the name, but absolutely not the character. If I had known that, I could have saved some money.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 09-20-2017, 03:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T12:20:26-07:00","id":1142256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mizzlfoshizzl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1142198#post1142198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd want a kickstarter only *after* the word count/content is finalized. If it's packing more art / tchotchkes / etc. into the final product, that's cool; but I've had my fill of kickstarters to fund development/writing that get delayed ad infinitum.</div> </div> </div> </div>You and me both!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T14:11:28-07:00","id":1142299,"title":"","content":"On a mechanical level, I'd love to see something like what Scion's 2E Kickstarter did, where the core book was basically defined and then you had a &quot;Scion Companion&quot; where all the fancy stretch goals went AFTER the core book was done. It seems a nice trade off between &quot;Stretch goals get you more stuff&quot; and &quot;you don't want the book ballooning out of control so that it continually has to reassess what's going to be in the book. As far as actual story/game mechanics content, I'm fairly satisfied so far with what the current development team have been previewing, so I'm willing to be surprised.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1817-opmegs","name":"OpMegs","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1817_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T14:47:49-07:00","id":1142306,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'd love to have like, a Caste Book companion piece; where MAs, artifacts, extra writeups and other stretch-goal stuff could appear later, rather than delaying the base rulebook.<br /> <br /> I'd actually kind of like a starter adventure, in the vein of Tomb of Hidden Dreams, but DB specific? Like a new Wyld Hunt forming under desperate circumstances, or something terrible happened at the heptegram, and you and your brotherhood are being sent in to investigate. Just something DB-focused for newish players.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1982-spacepup","name":"Spacepup","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T14:55:38-07:00","id":1142312,"title":"","content":"I really liked Miracles of the Solar Exalted, a similar Dragonblood charm expansion is on the top of my list.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T20:08:15-07:00","id":1142389,"title":"","content":"A completely finished text-only draft, ready for delivery as soon as the Kickstarter money clears. Otherwise I'm just not interested in Onyx Path Kickstarters any more I'm afraid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T20:28:46-07:00","id":1142396,"title":"","content":"A Finger for every month late.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T21:18:05-07:00","id":1142409,"title":"","content":"Remember the Aspect Books from 1E?<br /> <br /> I want a mini-book for each Dragonblooded House.<br /> <br /> Also, I'd love to see less weird clunky digital art and more traditional pieces. 3E's visual style is nowhere near as good as it was in the last two editions, camel-toe sorceresses notwithstanding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T07:42:26-07:00","id":1142501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HighPriest</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1142389#post1142389\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A completely finished text-only draft, ready for delivery as soon as the Kickstarter money clears. Otherwise I'm just not interested in Onyx Path Kickstarters any more I'm afraid.</div> </div> </div> </div>As unprofessional as a text-only draft is... I'd like that. We've got games waiting on it.<br /> <br /> <br /> I admit, I basically don't care what's in the Kickstarter as long as it doesn't make the book take longer. Or later books. So maybe a payrise for the writers? Writers probably write faster when they're not starving or worrying about bills.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T13:38:57-07:00","id":1142676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1142501#post1142501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So maybe a payrise for the writers? Writers probably write faster when they're not starving or worrying about bills.</div> </div> </div> </div>They did that for the 3E core. Two payraises were stretch goals, totaling a 20% raise for the creative team. Suffice to say, I doubt it significantly sped up the process.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","user":"HighPriest","date":". 09-21-2017, 04:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2433-highpriest","name":"HighPriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2433_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T13:56:41-07:00","id":1142683,"title":"","content":"I'd be very happy to see a pay increase for the writers.<br /> <br /> I'd also love to see something similar to Miracles, with either backer charms, cut/expanded content, or some combination thereof. Hopefully that wouldn't bloat the release timeline for Lunars too much, but would still give us something exciting. Plus, it would be great to have a place for things cut from WFHR and The Realm (or even Arms) for word count reasons.<br /> <br /> While I'd love smaller releases a la the 1e Aspect Books, I think that might be just a little too much of an extra project. Lunars isn't even in 1st Draft yet, so if the KS bogs down the devs with extra projects, I worry about another long release drought.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10995-abakus","name":"Abakus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T15:28:36-07:00","id":1142723,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1142501#post1142501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As unprofessional as a text-only draft is... I'd like that. We've got games waiting on it.<br /> <br /> <br /> I admit, I basically don't care what's in the Kickstarter as long as it doesn't make the book take longer. Or later books. So maybe a payrise for the writers? Writers probably write faster when they're not starving or worrying about bills.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't call it unprofessional. I'd call it one step short of an ebook :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-22T01:03:02-07:00","id":1142833,"title":"","content":"Hmm, here's an idea for a stretch: additional settjng material involving minor outcaste groups. While Lookshy and Lost Eggs should be in the book itself, maybe the authors could whip up a few minor groups that could be out there as well, and have the material, only a few pages each, as additional material. If the KS exceeds it's goals, they'll release the supplements as stretch goals. Later, after the book ismout they can also be released for sale on DTRPG for those who missed the KS.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-22T08:07:08-07:00","id":1142907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1142501#post1142501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I admit, I basically don't care what's in the Kickstarter as long as it doesn't make the book take longer. Or later books. So maybe a payrise for the writers? Writers probably write faster when they're not starving or worrying about bills.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm all in favor of giving the authors more money, but let's keep our expectations realistic. Unless such a Kickstarter can provide them enough money that they can quit their day jobs or quit school and focus on writing full time, I doubt giving them more money would really speed up how much work they can accomplish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-22T12:56:54-07:00","id":1143012,"title":"","content":"A storytelller guide of some sort? Just saying there are a number of options that would be helpful and figuring our how to use the Realm from different perspectives is somewhat reasonable to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-22T16:34:28-07:00","id":1143080,"title":"","content":"Do I want it?<br /> <br /> Yes and no. Yes I want it, but god damn it's going to be hard not to blow three weeks pay on it if it happens.<br /> <br /> <br /> Things I want<br /> <br /> - Pay bump for writers<br /> <br /> - Full colour art for the book. DBs needs colour<br /> <br /> - Assistant Comic. Those are cool and don't take much dev time.<br /> <br /> - Dice sets and other small trinkets like bookmarks would be cool<br /> <br /> - And the big one. A Jade version of the book with faux jade cover and 5 colour bound bookmarks attached. I'm not comfortable saying how much money I'd spend on this to get it. I may even make my own if one isn't available","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T00:30:51-07:00","id":1143165,"title":"","content":"Text done prior to release - released at the end of the funding.<br /> Color art throughout - 100% this.<br /> House specific crunch (Sorcery, artifacts, MA, Charms) and fluff. <br /> - pinnacle charms for specific houses with an explanation as to where the charm originated, as an example.<br /> None realm/house/genes dragon blooded organizations written up (five shade association, white viel society, Forest Witches etc.), with accompanying crunch. <br /> An ST Screen.<br /> Another cloth map of creation released.<br /> All written conctent in its own supplement away from the main book as to not delay its release. All released as .pdfs and available for PoD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T19:47:38-07:00","id":1143643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1142181-what-would-you-want-in-a-dragon-blooded-kickstarter?p=1142202#post1142202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They've already officially committed to that criteria going forward. And no, I don't have a quote sadly but I remember it distinctly.</div> </div> </div> </div>I saw it at the end of March, in <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-exalted-3rd-edition/posts/1843398\" target=\"_blank\">update #101</a> to the Deluxe <b>Exalted</b> 3rd Edition KS, the announcement that the law firm of Minton &amp; Vance was getting up to speed on <b>Tomb of Dreams</b> and <b>Arms of the Chosen</b>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">They are also in the process of assigning the remaining writing that needs to be done on the <b>Dragon Blooded</b> and <b>The Realm</b> books. Most of the writing for both books has been completed, so once they get used to our process for hiring writers and contracting and all that, we can nail down expectations on when the text will be done. Which is really important, because we won\u2019t be Kickstarting <b>Dragon Blooded</b> until the text is completely finished.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1426-aberranteyes","name":"AberrantEyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}